; On Wine, we load our DLL as a dinput8 proxy at startup instead of injecting it. The game then
; imports its DirectInput functions from us, so we mirror the original DLL by forwarding them to the
; Proton builtin: dinput8_hook.dll. GetdfDIJoystick is missing because Proton does not export it.
; Native Windows dinput8 does, but on Windows we inject and never use these exports.

EXPORTS
DirectInput8Create=dinput8_hook.DirectInput8Create
DllCanUnloadNow=dinput8_hook.DllCanUnloadNow
DllGetClassObject=dinput8_hook.DllGetClassObject
DllRegisterServer=dinput8_hook.DllRegisterServer
DllUnregisterServer=dinput8_hook.DllUnregisterServer